{"asset_key":"timeline/dialoguetree_story_10105010","episode":"timeline","category":"dialoguetree_story","story_id":"10105010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1010501001:0":{"text":"안되겠어요... 수비병이 여전히 많으니 다른 길을 찾아보도록 하죠.","source_cn":"不行啊……守卫还是很多，找别的路吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37037C4E2178D6EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010501002:0":{"text":"마스터도 보셨겠지만, 장원 밖은 수비병뿐만 아니라 마법의 장벽으로 감싸져 있어요.","source_cn":"主人，你肯定发现了，庄园外不仅有卫兵把守，甚至还被一层...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x04F3E91C1A93B154","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터도 보셨겠지만, 장원 밖은 수비병뿐만 아니라 마법의 장벽으로 감싸져 있어요.","female":"마스터도 보셨겠지만, 장원 밖은 수비병뿐만 아니라 마법의 장벽으로 감싸져 있어요.","variant_male_record_index":"98345","variant_female_record_index":"98346","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010501003:0":{"text":"로드 프란츠... 역시나 마법사와 손을 잡았어요!","source_cn":"弗朗茨果然和魔法师有勾结！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BE95E005A598204","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"로드 프란츠... 역시나 마법사와 손을 잡았어요!","female":"로드 프란츠... 역시나 마법사와 손을 잡았어요!","variant_male_record_index":"98347","variant_female_record_index":"98348","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010501004:0":{"text":"크게 한 바퀴 돈 다음, 장원 뒤쪽에서 잠입할 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"我们能不能绕个大圈，从后边潜入庄园？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67A747D5490A5645","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010501005:0":{"text":"이 근처는 제가 잘 아는데, 길은 여기밖에 없어요.","source_cn":"我对附近很熟，只有这一条路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2A7B3E1C6672333","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010501006:0":{"text":"이상하네. 지하에서 대화하는 소리가 들려요.\n음? 지하...? 여기에 지하인이?","source_cn":"不对，我能听见地下有人在说话。\\n嗯？地下……？这里还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x774ED49FC67119B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010501007:0":{"text":"...생각났어요! 로드 프란츠는 만일의 사태에 대비해 장원 지하에 비밀 통로를 여러 개 만들어두었다고 자랑한 적이 있어요!","source_cn":"——我想起来了！弗朗茨曾经吹嘘过，他在庄园里设了几条密...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20BE8ED4877A2B15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010501008:0":{"text":"보통 귀족의 저택에 비밀 통로가 몇 개씩은 있어요. 제 거처에도 있고요.","source_cn":"贵族宅邸一般都会有几个秘密出口，我的行馆也有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x697D3FA4A914C4CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010501009:0":{"text":"허, 귀족이 아니라 몰랐네요. 죄송합니다.","source_cn":"呵，不是贵族，没有这方面经验，真是抱歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5157D7B3555E006F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010501010:0":{"text":"이봐, 토끼 귀. 비밀 통로 입구가 어디 있는지 알겠어?","source_cn":"兔耳朵，你能听出密道入口在哪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B81A9224EEED941","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1010501011:0":{"text":"어... 아니요... 마법 장벽 때문에 방향이 잘 들리지 않아요.","source_cn":"呃……不行……都怪那层魔法壁垒，我根本听不清楚方位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4D4E64C99DD1AAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1010501012:0":{"text":"이렇게 된 이상 <style=\"highlight\">바람</style>의 도움을 받을 수밖에 없겠네요.","source_cn":"事到如今，只能让<style=highlight>风<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40E0CBC48B9F8200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1010501013:0":{"text":"바람? 바람의 도움을 어떻게 받지?","source_cn":"风？风要怎么帮你？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85D0816CBB5D178C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1010501014:0":{"text":"아, 제가 말 안 했던가요? 저는 귀가 밝을 뿐 아니라, <style=\"highlight\">방랑자</style>이기도 하답니다.","source_cn":"我从没说过吗？我可不止耳朵好使，还是一名<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD68184FCB51C3DF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1010501015:0":{"text":"방랑자요? 숲의 주민 중, 아주 극소수만이 가진 능력이라고 들은 적이 있어요!","source_cn":"风语者？我知道，只有极少数森林的住民才能掌握这种能力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07B48AF75F2C84A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1010501016:0":{"text":"그 이름처럼, 방랑자는 바람과 소통할 수 있다죠!","source_cn":"正如其名，风语者可以和风沟通。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3ABBEFEE802DCCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1010501017:0":{"text":"카세디아 양은 역시 박학다식하네요.","source_cn":"不愧是博学多识的科丝蒂小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4842D27488825C4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1010501018:0":{"text":"맞아요, 마법을 사용해서 바람과 대화를 하고 이 난관을 헤쳐 나갈 방법을 물어보도록 할게요.","source_cn":"是的，接下来，我要使用魔法，和风对话，请它指引我们走出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE54E445A610205","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:罗万":{"text":"로완","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:科丝蒂":{"text":"카세디아","source":"科丝蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":5}}